From 34957ba504a06a6543628c02619688ed1e7a0278 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 20:29:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER (tools 0155): one toolbar on the editor title bar;
 the status bar shows information only
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1003: "按鈕可以不要加圖片位置? 加在上方可以嗎? ... 列一條工具列 把工具列都列上去 下面藍色顯示資訊就好"
- package.json editor/title, navigation@-30..-19, in this order: back, forward,
  build+start, continue, pause, stop all, restart, step over / into / out,
  模擬 (beaker = on / circle-slash = off), Debug (bug = on / debug-disconnect =
  off). Each has an icon and "enablement" (greyed when it cannot act, never
  hidden); the on / off icons both call RunBar.toggle.
- RunBar.update sets context keys ht9045Designer.runState (idle / running /
  paused / building), runNoDbg, runCanStop (not idle, or a wb_* exe running).
- The status bar: RunBar's items hidden (kept: 方案總管's toolbar reads their
  state), 0153's back / forward items removed -- information only there now.

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (the 14 title bar buttons in order, icons, greyed /
not hidden, the commands they run, the switches, the context keys per state,
nothing in the status bar); real VS Code 156/159 (the 3 known stale checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
